 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Laplace’s Demon — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>A thought experiment proposing an intellect so vast it knows the position and momentum of every particle, allowing it to predict the future and recall the past.</p></blockquote><p>Starting at 1st level, you have extreme control of your emotions with a logical mindset allowing you to use Intelligence as your Cursed Energy modifier. You can spend 1 CE as a bonus action to overclock your brain for 1 minute, gaining the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>You can spend 2 CE to take an action as a reaction.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You gain advantage on Intelligence checks.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You add your Intelligence modifier to AC and Dexterity saves.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You gain the 2000 IQ Skill feat.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
